window.products.push({"id":1024227,"name":"Faux Fur Duvet Cover Set Plush Shaggy Fluffy Fuzzy Soft Warm Cozy Velvet Comforter Bedding Cover with Ties Zipper Closure (1 Duvet Cover + 2 Pillowcas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8131+YFE8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【CRAFT】：This product can bring you warmth and comfort. Put your duvet in the duvet cover, the surface of the cover has very long fluff, which can keep warm in the coldest winter.We do our best to improve quality.For example,we use the world-famous YKK zippers to ensure high quality. There are 6 ties in the duvet cover, which can firmly fix the duvet, so don't worry about the duvet moving freely in the cover. It is suitable as a gift for Christmas and birthday, send warmth to your loved ones. 【SIZE INFORMATION】：Twin:1 pc duvet cover 66\"x90\",1 pc pillowcase 20\"x26\". Queen:1 pc duvet cover 90\"x90\",2 pcs pillowcases 20\"x26x\". King:1 pc duvet cover 104\"x90\",2 pcs pillowcases 20\"x36\".NO DUVET INSERT. 【MATERIALS】：The front of the duvet cover and pillowcase is made of 100% polyester 45 mm high thick faux fur,and the back is ultra soft crystal mink fabric. 【CARE INSTRUCTION】：Turning it inside-out,machine wash cold on gentle cycle.Tumble dry low or dry flat.Do not bleach.Do not Iron.Avoid hang dry which will cause deformation,comb the fleece to regain fluffiness and smoothness after washing.We suggest washing before first use as it sheds a bit for produce cutting and is more skin friendly. 【AFTERSALES SERVICE】：We provide 30-day return and replacement service.Any questions,PLS contact us freely,we will reply you and help you resolve the problem within 24 hours and give you a satisfied answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8131+YFE8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L'AGRATY","source_asin":"B08DMR124T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DMR124T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DMR124T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1024228,"name":"TreeWool (Pack of 2) Decorative Throw Pillow Covers Geometric Squares Accent in 100% Cotton Canvas (18 x 18 Inches, Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zmFx320lL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"Brand : TreeWool Box Contains : 2 Piece Cushion Cover / Shell only. Cushions are not included.   Carefully hand finished for a superior quality Cushion Cover that is sure to add a great accent to your living room, lounge or bedroom. PRODUCT FEATURES 1. Each unit is made with 100% light weight cotton canvas for increased durability  2. Each unit has a high quality hidden / concealed zipper, that allows for easy insertion and removal of pillow inserts  3. In the inside, all fabric edges are stitched with overlock stitches to avoid fray and increase durability of cushion covers  4. These throw pillow cases are suitable for use in sofa / couch & beds  5. Fully machine washable in cold setting. To increase the life of your cushion covers, follow the care instructions provided in the label. GOOD TO KNOW BEFORE YOU BUY 1. Due to differences in color saturation settings between each Computer, Laptop, Tablet or Phone the actual product might have a minor color difference to the picture on screen. 2. As each product is entirely handmade, there may be minor size variation ( + or - 0.5 cm ) CHOOSING THE RIGHT PILLOW COVERS (OR) PILLOWS 1. Measure 2 adjacent sides of existing pillows. This will give the size of the pillow cover to choose. E.g., if the pillow is 16 x 16 Inch on the sides, then the pillow cover to choose is 16 x 16 Inch. 2. If buying new pillows, then a) Choose either the same size pillows as the pillow covers (e.g., 16x16 Inch Cover = 16x16 Inch Pillow) (OR) b) Choose up to a maximum of 2 inch bigger pillows than the pillow covers to get a full and plump pillows.(e.g., 16x16 Inch Cover = Up to 18x18 Inch Pillow) ABOUT TREEWOOL We bring our expertise in Home Fashion sector in Europe to the US.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zmFx320lL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeWool","source_asin":"B01J1GU0Z8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J1GU0Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J1GU0Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
