window.products.push({"id":1024233,"name":"merka Placemats for Kids Placemat Kids Placemats for Dining Table Educational Placemats for Kids Math Addition Subtraction Multiplication and Division","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tURFxT4jL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"PERFECT BLEND OF EDUCATION AND FUN FOR KIDS: Designed by experienced teachers, they offer a unique learning experience for kids of all ages, from pre-K to grade school. As children enjoy their breakfast, lunch, or dinner, they can learn addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, & fractions. The placemats are made from durable silicone, ensuring they are easy to clean. In addition to math skills, the placemats also feature a periodic table, making them a great tool for young scientists. SILICONE PLACEMATS WITH NON-SLIP BACKING: These placemats stay put on the table & are easy to clean up afterward which makes mealtime less messy for parents. A simple wipe with a damp cloth is all it takes to make them look brand new again. These placemats are perfect for busy parents who want to spend more time enjoying their meals & less time cleaning up after them. Plus, they come in a variety of colors & designs to match any kitchen decor. Say goodbye to spills & stains with these placemats. BPA-FREE PLASTIC: Merka is a brand that prides itself on providing safe & healthy products for its customers. They ensure that no harsh chemicals will be released during use. To protect the placemats during shipping, they are shipped with a clear adhesive film on the back. To ensure the best results when using the placemats, it is recommended to peel off & discard the clear adhesive film before use. With their commitment to quality & safety, you can enjoy using their products with peace of mind. PERFECT SIZE: These 17\"x11\" laminated educational placemats are perfect for children to enjoy a meal or snack at the dining table or breakfast bar. The mats provide ample surface area for kids to eat while also serving as an educational tool with fun & colorful graphics. Made with high-quality materials, these mats are durable & easy to clean, making them a practical addition to any family's mealtime routine. Parents are sure that their little ones will enjoy eating & learning at the same time. EXTENSIVE COLLECTION OF EDUCATIONAL PLACEMATS: These placemats are perfect for toddlers, grade schoolers, and teens. With a range of topics from numbers, letters, art, science, and more, they are ideal teaching aids for both home and school use. These placemats offer a fun and interactive way for kids to learn and explore various subjects. They are durable, easy to clean, and make great gift ideas for any occasion. Choose from a variety of designs and inspire your child's learning journey today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tURFxT4jL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"merka","source_asin":"B09GF8952H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GF8952H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GF8952H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
