window.products.push({"id":1024623,"name":"Set of 2 Solid Copper Moscow Mule Mugs - Two 16oz Hammered 100% Copper Moscow Mule Mugs with No Inner Lining - Includes Bonus Cocktail Recipe Cards an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EdLWFRDHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Two 16 ounce capacity 100% pure copper mugs  Double jigger with .75 & 1.5 ounce capacity  Recipe cards that ensure you’ll always know how to mix up fun drinks Support: We stand fully behind our products. If you have any post purchase concerns or questions, let us know. We will quickly respond to any questions you may have. Lifetime Guarantee If for some reason you experience a manufacturing defect or product quality issue with your mug set, we will replace it. Your satisfaction is our #1 Priority.   Unlike many other copper mugs on Amazon, our Moscow Mule Mugs are constructed of 100% Pure Copper. Why drink from mugs made from 100% copper? It's simple. Pure copper is the only metal that reacts properly with citric acid, commonly found in Limes, Lemons, and Oranges. The Citric acid and Copper reaction is an essential flavor in the classic Moscow Mule. Drinking from a mug lined with nickel or coated with food lacquer does not provide the true flavor of the classic Moscow Mule.   Your copper mugs are made of 100% copper and aren't lined with any cheap metals or food lacquers, which ensures you get the authentic experience, no matter what you choose to drink from your Mugs. Your purchase of 2 mugs includes a Copper Double Jigger, completely free! We also include a set of cocktail recipe cards, so you always know how to mix classic and delicious drinks for yourself and your friends that are an excellent addition to your mug set and free double jigger. Don't wait, click Add to Cart to get your CopperWorks Mugs, Double Jigger and Cocktail Recipe Cards Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EdLWFRDHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Copper Works","source_asin":"B016RGADW0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016RGADW0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016RGADW0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
