window.products.push({"id":1024711,"name":"FAPO Bed Sheet Set -All partent (6 Piece King, Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CB6L2m2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brushed microfiber sheet: The brushed microfiber surface has a soft feel to it that compares to other materials, offers an incredibly deep sleep experience featuring a silky-smooth soft feel. Polyester sheets are soft which allows for broad use, best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room, also a great gift choice for Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. Best cooling sheet : Fapo Bed Sheet Set is so comfortable because the fabric design causes it to be airy yet warm to the body, these qualities provide a better atmosphere of rest for your body during the night, you will surely get the deepest sleep experience when your bodies are cool and comfortable. Polyester is also wrinkling resistant helping your sheets stay cleaner for longer. Excellent quality sheet: As the sheets are shrink resistant, the care of the sheet set is very easy, these sheets will endure normal washing. please washing in cool water(with similar colors) and drying on low heat on the tumble cycle, this will help secure the life of the luxury bed sheet set. Also, if you can iron at a normal temperature, you can maintain the beauty of the sheets for a long time. Luxury king Bed Sheet: Contained 1 flat sheet 102\" x 105 \", 1 fitted sheets 80\" x 78\", 4 pillowcases 20\" x 40\". All-around elastic on 16\" fitted sheet allows for secure fit of most mattress sizes up to a 16\" mattress depth. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee: We committed to the 100% customer satisfaction experience, for any reason, any time, if you don't satisfy you can contact us for a refund.（You don’t even need to return the product）","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CB6L2m2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAPO","source_asin":"B08KZPVCF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KZPVCF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KZPVCF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1024712,"name":"PK Green Battery Tea Lights | Set of 12 Blue Flickering LED Candles | Realistic Flameless Electric Tealights | Decorative Battery Operated Fake LED Vo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jLIqCuhDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether the nights are closing in and the air is growing chilly, or whether you want to recreate the relaxing blue glow of the sea in your very own living room; these versatileblue LED tealights are guaranteed to set the mood perfectly, whatever the occasion. The candles, with their realistic flickering flame effect, offer the ideal solution to the mess, fuss and potential hazards of naked flame, and, with easily replaceable batteries, they are100% portable. Should you want to feature them sparkling on the top of a high bookshelf at a soiree, or have them hidden in the garden for a special, night-time treasure hunt; the possibilities are endless, and our tealights have no unsightly wires to get in the way. So, whatever the occasion, be it to create a soft, wintry glow at a Christmas get together, or a cool blue shine at a lively birthday party, these LED tealights are the perfect addition to your event. With their24-48 hours of continuous shine time, and easily replaceable batteries, they are guaranteed to keep on shining, time after time. Note: All PK Green tea lights come in aglossy finish colour gift box. The batteries are pre-installed so you can enjoy them straight away.- Height: 4.3cm (including flame) - Diameter: 3.6cm - Battery requirements: 1 x CR2032 battery in each candle (included, replaceable, and extra batteries available from goforgreen) What you get12 blue LED candles in a colour gift box.These lights are also available in different colours in our Amazon storefront - including amber, white, colour changing, pink, red and green. We also stock a range of other LED candles and candle holders.These LED candles are exclusively manufactured for PK Green - we hold design copyrights and exclusive distributor rights for this model of LED candles in the EU.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jLIqCuhDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PK Green","source_asin":"B003V9R8FC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003V9R8FC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003V9R8FC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
