window.products.push({"id":1024730,"name":"Homend Stainless Steel Meat Press for Making Healthy Homemade Deli Meat with Thermometer,Include 20 PCS Cooking Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E7u-pq6BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features The meat press made from high-quality food grade stainless steel material, it's durable, rust proof and easy to clean. Package contains 20 cooking bags for grease it very well to get the meat out again without pulling it to pieces. You can prepare yummy sandwich meat out of pork, beef, poultry, fish and seafood effortlessly and enhance your family’s diet  Specifications Height: 16.5cm(6.49inch) Marerial: Stainless steel Color: Silver Diameter: 10cm(3.94inch) Product Capacity: 1.5 L (2 lb meat) Product Weight: 0.495kg  How to use 1.When using for the first time, please wash it thoroughly in warm water or in a dishwasher rinse well and dry. 2.Put prepared meat inside meat press. 3.Insert pressure plate with attached spring. The pressure plate should press meat and the spring should face up. Close the meat press with a lid. 4.Place the meat press into a pot filled with water simmer for about 2-3 hours. 5.When ready, remove the meat press from water, cool it and refrigerate until meat is cold. Pour warm or hot water on meat press's body to remove meat easily.  Package Included 1x Meat press's body 1x Pressure plate with spring 1x Lid with handle 1x Thermometer 20x Cooking Bags  NOTICE: This device is not a toy. Please keep out of reach of children. Do not place the meat press directly on the fire or heating plate. Do not leave thermometer inside the meat press during cooking, it can become hot. Check temperature periodically. Allow to cool before opening the meat press.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E7u-pq6BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homend","source_asin":"B07X1WQFCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X1WQFCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X1WQFCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
