window.products.push({"id":1024793,"name":"Privacy Window Film,Frosted Stained Glass Window Decals,Non-Adhesive UV Proof Static Window Clings,Removable Stained Glass Window Sticker for Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PjPXiTnFL._AC_.jpg","description":"NOTE: This blackout window glass film is not glue and uses a lot of water to paste, only use on smooth glass surface. It is reusable. If you need other sizes, please contact us. window film function: 1. Get a pretty interior! Condensation Prevention -Just stick it on clear glass with water and it will turn into a stylish stained glass window! 2. Sun Adjustment UV Cut - Cuts out a large amount of harmful ultraviolet rays that enter through the glass. It has the effect of reducing discoloration and deterioration of furniture, flooring materials, exhibits, carpets inside buildings, etc. window glass film specifications: Material: Environmental PVC. Waterproof function: waterproof. Usage: smooth glass surface (windows, sliding doors, showcases, etc.). Usage: decoration, insulation, privacy protection, etc. Glass film size: Thickness: 0.249 mm Intall Notes window film: 1.Applies to smooth surfaces, does not stick to rough or uneven glass. Like bonded glass (double glazing) or wire reinforced glass, if the surface is flat (smooth), it can be applied neatly. 2. Make sure to remove the protective film (unnecessary film) attached to the glass film. Note that if you skip this step, the glued glass film will come off. 3. In the cold winter months, the film can harden when rolled up and can float when glued. The solution is to heat the film with a hair dryer to remove the habit before application. Alternatively, soak it in warm water for a while and stick it when it becomes soft. 4. It is not recommended to use it outside the window as the service life will be greatly reduced.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PjPXiTnFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0C59H79RQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1024793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C59H79RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C59H79RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
